                      "text":  "Elementary Schools, Middle Schools, Edison High School and John P. Stevens High School\n| ELEMENTARY SCHOOLS Grades K-5 | MIDDLE SCHOOLS | HIGH SCHOOLS\nREGULAR SCHOOL HOURS | 8:55 AM 3:30 PM | 8:25 AM 3:00 PM | 7:40 AM 2:30 PM\nDELAYED OPENING | 10:55 AM 3:30 PM | 10:25 AM 3:00 PM | 9:40 AM 2:30 PM\nSINGLE SESSION/ EARLY DISMISSAL | 8:55 AM 1:30 PM | 8:25 AM 1:00 PM | 7:40 AM 12:00 PM\nEdison Success Academy\n| FULL DAY\nREGULAR SCHOOL HOURS | 8:15 AM 2:00 PM\nDELAYED OPENING | 10:15 AM 2:00 PM\nSINGLE SESSION/EARLY DISMISSAL | 8:15 AM 12:00 PM\nEELC\n| FULL DAY\nREGULAR SCHOOL HOURS | 9:30 AM 3:30 PM\nDELAYED OPENING | 11:30 AM 3:30 PM\nSINGLE SESSION/EARLY DISMISSAL | 9:30 AM 1:30 PM\nFDR\n| FULL DAY\nREGULAR SCHOOL HOURS | 8:30 AM 2:30 PM\nDELAYED OPENING | 10:30 AM 2:30 PM\nSINGLE SESSION/EARLY DISMISSAL | 8:30 AM 12:30 PM",
