                      "text":  "The mission of the Special Services Department is to provide appropriate support and educational services to students, staff and parents. Every year, each student’s educational program is developed in alignment with the student’s individual needs and the District’s goals.\nWe believe in a Team-Based Approach and encourage parents, students, and district staff to fully participate in the development and delivery of our student’s educational programs. We believe in open communication and welcome feedback from community stakeholders. These relationships translate to a positive and productive academic experience for our students.\nRead more from Dr Toohey here.",
