                      "id":  "district:studentsquare-introduction",
                      "title":  "StudentSquare",
                      "text":  "StudentSquare\nEdison Township Public Schools will begin using StudentSquare as a new medium for communication between students in its public schools.\nStudentSquare is a safe, secure, and modern approach to communication and collaboration between students.\nUse this portal to learn more about the functionality and various tools associated with StudentSquare\u0027s integration with Edison Township.\nWhat is StudentSquare?\nStudentSquare is a platform that helps students stay connected with their school: providing important updates, easy communication with teachers, and a centralized place for school news and announcements. Students can login to StudentSquare on their computers, and download the app on their cell phones.\nVideo Tutorials\nDownload The App!\nDownload our FREE StudentSquare app for iOS or Android. This is the easiest way for you to receive all Posts, Events, Sign Up Requests, Photos and Files. You can enable text notifications when a message is posted.",
