                      "text":  "A Message from Mr. McGrath\nDear Parents/Guardians \u0026 Students,\nI’m happy to welcome you to Herbert Hoover Middle School. The 2025-2026 academic year promises our scholars outstanding academic achievement and personal growth. United as one school community, we strive to challenge and support all scholars. This year promises to be our best yet with a comprehensive offering of academic courses, social programs, extracurricular activities, clubs, sports, and events! Herbert Hoover is a 21st-century school committed to providing each student with the knowledge, skills, and disposition required to succeed in school and, most importantly, in life.\nMiddle school is an exciting time filled with learning, fun, exploration, and boundless possibilities. The faculty and staff of Herbert Hoover Middle School are honored to play a pivotal role in the education and development of our scholars. We, like you, want your child to be successful, well-rounded, and prepared for high school, college, and beyond. Through open and frequent communication, this will be achieved. We are all on this journey together, and I am confident that if we remain focused on our scholars, we will have a successful year.\nI eagerly look forward to a wonderful school year filled with learning, fun, and growth for our scholars.\nSincerely,\nMr. McGrath",
