                      "id":  "jomes:attendance",
                      "title":  "John Marshall - Attendance",
                      "text":  "To report an absence or a tardy, please call before 9:30 am:\n732-650-5370 and Press 1\nClearly state child\u0027s name, ID number, teacher, and reason for absence.\nOr enter your child\u0027s absence in the Genesis Parent Portal .\nImportant parent notice!!\nIn case of inclement weather, our automated messaging service will call you if school is canceled or delayed. You can also check the website. When we have a delayed opening, school begins at:\n10:55 a.m. for grades K-5\nIf your child is a walker, the child is not to report to school before 10:45 a.m.\nThere is no a.m. Latchkey on delayed openings.\nThere is no p.m. Latchkey on early dismissals.",
