                      "text":  "Our Mission and Values!\nAt Woodrow Wilson Middle School, we believe in a diverse and inclusive community, committed to empowering all students to be open-minded, value the process of learning, demonstrate resilience, display empathy, and build the confidence necessary to reach their highest potential.",
